  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1502.31 In or on the borders of surface waters of the state",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1502.31 “In or on the borders of surface waters of the state” means at or below the high water mark of any surface water, or on any land within such a distance of a surface water that direct or immediate water quality degradation could result from the activities occurring on the land.\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.29); ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.33)",
